              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Aso do kiner ebe, ‘Inera kwanata Ejakait EDEKE ebe: Karaida kalema kes kama elwana kotoma atekerin, karaida keweliwel kes kotoma akwapin, konye araun aibois nakalaunan kamakee nediokasilon kotoma akwapin nuadoloto.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
